# An allowlist: the build context is what the image build reads and nothing
# else. The root .env holds the dev DATABASE_URL and .claude/worktrees holds
# whole checkouts, so everything starts excluded.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/
!packages/
!bin/

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.test.*
**/.env*
